2026-05-10 | bugfix | macOS ScreenCaptureKit -3821 "stream stopped by system" interruptions traced to system-audio capture path. Disabling "Include macOS System Audio" eliminates the issue. Root cause is muxing display + system audio + microphone through a single SCRecordingOutput, which is unstable on macOS 15.x. Mitigation: keep system audio off for long recordings; 0.1.4 segment-recovery code remains as defensive net.
